      "writtenOn": "2025-02-24T21:54:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm. If the memory was previously shared with the guest, why is it safe to return here? When the guest is torn down, won\u0027t the reclaim logic transition the page back to host-owned?",
