      "writtenOn": "2025-02-24T22:59:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a bit strange for borrowed.\n\nSo, MMIO can\u0027t be shared from guest to host (the HVC will fail) so it\u0027s impossible to have an MMIO borrowed in the host state, and this relies on re-using that instead of adding new state for DMA_MMIO.\nWhere basically pages that have been mapped in the IOMMU page table, gets tained by marking them as borrowed and that can never change.",
      "parentUuid": "d2d20613_e09f29a4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1765,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 1765,
        "endChar": 15
